close_reason: Injected the host-bound SDK and portable workspace context into importer/exporter handlers with typed compatibility and test coverage.
body: "GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/749\n\nScope is the missing execution-context injection and its public testing/documentation contract. Registration metadata and name-based test invocation are already shipped; do not duplicate those surfaces."
